idth=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"118\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/felloak.gif\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Felloak</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">Club</font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>One-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(3.4-3.6) To (11.9-12.6)</font> (7.65-8.1 Avg)<br>Required Level: \n3<br>Durability: 24<br>Base Weapon Speed: [-10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+70-80% \nEnhanced Damage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% Damage To \nUndead</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 6-8 Fire Damage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Knockback</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Lightning Resist \n+60%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Fire Resist +20%</font><br>(Only Spawns In \nPatch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>한손데미지 \n                            : <font color=\"#4850b8\">(3.4-3.6) To (11.9-12.6)</font> (7.65-8.1 Avg)<br>레벨요구치 : \n3<br>내구력 : 24<br>무기기본속도 : [-10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+70-80% \n증가된 데미지</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% 언데드계열에대한 데미지 증가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">6-8 파이어 데미지 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">뒤로밀침</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">라이트닝 저항력 +60%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">파이어 저항력 +20%</font><br>(Only Spawns In \nPatch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p 